---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'May 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — The Playbook RE"
  description="The terms governing your use of The Playbook RE website and content."
>
  <div class="legal-hero">
    <div class="legal-hero-inner">
      <div class="legal-eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-body">
    <div class="legal-inner">

      <p class="legal-intro">By accessing or using The Playbook RE, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, don't use the site. These terms are written to be readable, not to obscure anything.</p>

      <h2>The Content</h2>
      <p>Everything published on The Playbook RE — articles, playbooks, scripts, templates, guides, and all other written content — is the original work of Chris Linsell or credited contributors and is protected by copyright.</p>
      <p><strong>You may:</strong> read, share links to, quote briefly with attribution, and apply the strategies in your own business.</p>
      <p><strong>You may not:</strong> reproduce, republish, scrape, resell, or redistribute full articles or substantial portions of content — in any form, on any platform — without written permission.</p>

      <h2>The Toolkit Resources</h2>
      <p>Resources available through The Toolkit are provided free for personal professional use. You may use them in your own real estate business. You may not resell, repackage, or distribute them as your own work.</p>

      <h2>No Warranties</h2>
      <p>The content on The Playbook RE is published for informational and educational purposes. Real estate markets, regulations, and business conditions vary. Nothing here constitutes legal, financial, or brokerage advice.</p>
      <p>We make no guarantees about results. Strategies that work in one market, at one time, for one agent may not work everywhere. Apply your own judgment.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>We link to external sites including ChrisLinsell.com, tool providers, and referenced resources. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content, accuracy, or practices.</p>

      <h2>User Submissions</h2>
      <p>If you submit a pitch, suggestion, or article proposal through this site, you grant us the right to review and consider it. Submitting an idea does not obligate us to use it or compensate you for it.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, The Playbook RE and Chris Linsell are not liable for any damages arising from your use of this site or reliance on its content.</p>

      <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms at any time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent version. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of any changes.</p>

      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Michigan, without regard to conflict of law provisions.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@theplaybookre.com">hello@theplaybookre.com</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    background: var(--black);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
  }
  .legal-hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 40px 48px;
  }
  .legal-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 64px; line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .legal-meta {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #555;
  }

  .legal-body { background: var(--off-white); }
  .legal-inner {
    max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 40px 80px;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .legal-inner h2 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--black); margin: 36px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal-inner h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }

  .legal-inner p {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .legal-inner strong { color: var(--black); font-weight: 600; }
  .legal-inner a { color: var(--black); text-decoration: underline; }
  .legal-inner a:hover { color: var(--yellow); }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-hero-inner, .legal-inner { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
    .legal-title { font-size: 48px; }
  }
</style>
